Package: fdic
Title: R Interface to 'FDIC BankFind Suite API'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Dylan", "Hughes", , "dhughes@ketchbrookanalytics.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Ketchbrook Analytics", role = c("cph", "fnd"))
Description: Provides a convenient interface to the BankFind Suite API made
    available by the Federal Deposit Insurance Corporation ('FDIC'). Contains
    functions to retrieve data related to financial institution locations,
    structural change events, financial reports (both historic and current),
    summary of deposit reporting, and demographic information.
